  "metadata": {
    "name": "双面包板环境节点：XIAO ESP32-S3 Sense + 传感器 + SEN66",
    "revision": 2,
    "created_at": "2026-09-05T00:00:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-05T00:00:00.000Z",
    "description": "两块 400 孔板沿短边拼接（栅格对齐，几何拼接不导通）。板 A：XIAO ESP32-S3 Sense + SHT41/BMP390/LTR390 立式 I²C 模块，由 XIAO 3V3 供电；板 B：SEN66 线缆落点与独立 3.3 V 电源。两块板只共地，不并联 3.3 V。",
    "author": "Breadboard Studio examples",
    "tags": [
      "xiao",
      "esp32-s3",
      "sen66",
      "i2c",
      "example"
    ]
  },
